    "shortDescription": "Bounded Scala compiler, build, test, type, effect, symbol, reconciliation, and SemanticDB evidence for coding agents.",
    "longDescription": [
      "semantic-scala helps coding agents consult structured Scala compiler, build, test, type, effect, symbol, reconciliation, and SemanticDB evidence instead of relying only on source text.",
      "The Claude Code plugin contains one agent skill and one local stdio MCP server exposing exactly eight bounded tools. It works against local workspaces and can invoke local build or test commands only when the corresponding tool is explicitly selected.",
      "Version 0.1.0-alpha.3 is an experimental Linux x86_64 package for compatible GNU-libc environments with system zlib. The thin plugin requires Python 3.11 or newer and first-start network access to download and verify a fixed immutable runtime; warm starts reuse the owner-only cache and no host Java is required."
    ],
